    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Service at public counters",
     "texto": [
      "When you go to a citizen service desk («de balie» or «het loket»), you state the reason for your visit: «Ik heb een afspraak» (I have an appointment) or «Ik wil dit formulier invullen» (I want to fill in this form). The employee's courteous phrases include: «Neem plaats» (take a seat) and «Een collega helpt u zo» (a colleague will help you shortly)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
